    section.section.section--rules
        .container
            .rules-block
                .rules-block__top.js-inview
                    h2.title.title--section.title--ttu.title--bold.title--white COMPETITION RULES:
                .rules-block__list
                    .rules-item.js-inview
                        .rules-item__title Follow all the same rules for the <br> challenges:
                        .rules-item__sub 5% Max Daily Drawdown | 10% Max Total <br> Drawdown |  Minimum Trading Days
                        .rules-item__text A's are not allowed, no taking advantage of unrealistic fills in the demo environment, daily Drawdown will now be calculated based on Balance or Equity whichever is higher at the end of the day
                    .rules-item.js-inview
                        .rules-item__title There following lot size rules apply:
                        .rules-item__sub 5 Lot Max for Forex Pairs | 3 Lot Max for Indices | lot for Crypto, Commodities
                        .rules-item__text Positions max open at any given time, only 1 account per person is permitted, the competition starts on the first of the month and ends on the last day of the month. If you end up being one of the winners, someone from our Support Team will reach out with the appropriate prize.
